    "type": "question",
    "label": "2",
    "prompt": "A bowl contains green and red glass balls. The ratio of the number of green balls to the number of red balls is $2:3$. If there are 18 red balls, how many green balls are there?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "12 green balls.",
      "worked": "The red balls represent 3 parts.\n$$\\begin{align*}3\\text{ parts}&=18\\text{ balls}\\\\1\\text{ part}&=18\\div3=6\\text{ balls}\\\\2\\text{ parts}&=2\\times6=12\\text{ balls}\\end{align*}$$\nThere are 12 green balls.",
